pageType: content
notes: |
  Strategic roadmap and recommendations slide. Concludes the briefing with an actionable 10-year execution roadmap for three core stakeholder groups: institutional investors (funding supply-chain bottlenecks and milestone-gated tranches), electric utilities (signing early off-take PPAs and repurposing coal sites), and sovereign governments (codifying the US NRC 10 CFR Part 30 materials regulatory framework and funding 14 MeV neutron test facilities).
elements:
  # Header Kicker
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 26, 600, 16]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      text: "10 · STRATEGIC ROADMAP"

  # Header Title
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 42, 860, 30]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: "Actionable Roadmap for Investors, Utilities, and Industrial Policymakers Through 2035"

  # Header Subtitle
  - elementId: subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 72, 860, 16]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      text: "Targeted interventions across regulatory licensing, supply-chain scale-up, and public-private co-investment"

  # Header Divider
  - elementId: header-line
    elementType: line
    bounds: [50, 92, 860, 1]
    points: "0,0 860,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 0.8, color: "$border"}

  # Column 1: Investors
  - elementId: col-1-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [50, 106, 276, 268]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$cardBg"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 0.8, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: col-1-header
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [50, 106, 276, 28]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$titleNavy"}

  - elementId: col-1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [58, 111, 260, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      bold: true
      color: "$white"
      text: "1. INSTITUTIONAL INVESTORS"

  - elementId: col-1-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [58, 142, 260, 216]
    content:
      fontSize: 8.3
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.35
      text: |
        <p><b>Pivot to Supply-Chain Monopolies:</b></p>
        <p>Expand beyond generic reactor startups into critical component moats: REBCO tape manufacturers, high-purity ⁶Li isotope enrichment, and cryogenic vacuum valves.</p>
        <p><br><b>Milestone-Gated Capital Tranches:</b></p>
        <p>Condition follow-on Series B/C funding strictly on observable physical criteria (Lawson triple-product progress, divertor steady-state heat removal) rather than company PR milestones.</p>
        <p><br><b>Syndicated Infrastructure:</b></p>
        <p>Form joint venture capital consortiums to co-fund capital-intensive manufacturing facilities (e.g. continuous epitaxial tape deposition lines).</p>

  # Column 2: Utilities
  - elementId: col-2-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [342, 106, 276, 268]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$cardBg"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 0.8, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: col-2-header
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [342, 106, 276, 28]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accentBlue"}

  - elementId: col-2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [350, 111, 260, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      bold: true
      color: "$white"
      text: "2. UTILITIES & OFF-TAKERS"

  - elementId: col-2-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [350, 142, 260, 216]
    content:
      fontSize: 8.3
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.35
      text: |
        <p><b>Early Capacity Reservation PPAs:</b></p>
        <p>Structure long-term off-take Power Purchase Agreements (PPAs) around pilot plant capacity reservations, expanding upon Microsoft's 50 MW commitment to Helion (2028).</p>
        <p><br><b>Brownfield Site Repurposing:</b></p>
        <p>Initiate early grid interconnection and environmental reviews for compact 200–500 MW fusion units at retiring coal and fission plant sites, saving &gt;40% on civil and transmission capex.</p>
        <p><br><b>Turbine Island Co-Development:</b></p>
        <p>Engage directly with fusion vendors to standardize steam and sCO₂ turbine balance-of-plant interfaces to guarantee grid frequency compliance.</p>

  # Column 3: Policymakers
  - elementId: col-3-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [634, 106, 276, 268]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$cardBg"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 0.8, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: col-3-header
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [634, 106, 276, 28]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$orangeAccent"}

  - elementId: col-3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [642, 111, 260, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      bold: true
      color: "$white"
      text: "3. REGULATORS & GOVERNMENTS"

  - elementId: col-3-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [642, 142, 260, 216]
    content:
      fontSize: 8.3
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.35
      text: |
        <p><b>Harmonized Materials Licensing:</b></p>
        <p>Codify the US NRC landmark decision (April 2023) regulating fusion under 10 CFR Part 30 byproduct materials rules rather than cumbersome fission reactor mandates (Part 50), avoiding multi-billion regulatory delays.</p>
        <p><br><b>Strategic Isotope Reserves:</b></p>
        <p>Establish national strategic stockpiles of enriched Lithium-6 (&gt;90% enrichment required for breeding blankets) and non-military tritium allocations.</p>
        <p><br><b>14 MeV Neutron User Facilities:</b></p>
        <p>Accelerate public-private funding for high-flux 14 MeV neutron irradiation sources (IFMIF-DONES / domestic equivalents) to certify commercial first-wall steels.</p>

  # Watch Indicators Band
  - elementId: watch-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [50, 384, 860, 74]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$cardBg"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 0.8, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: watch-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [50, 384, 4, 74]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$orangeAccent"}

  - elementId: watch-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 398, 118, 46]
    content:
      fontSize: 7.5
      bold: true
      color: "$titleNavy"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      text: |
        <p>EXECUTION METRICS</p>
        <p>2026–2035</p>

  - elementId: watch-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [190, 398, 250, 46]
    content:
      fontSize: 7.5
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      text: |
        <p><b>Capital tranches tied to physics gates</b></p>
        <p>Condition follow-on funding on Lawson progress and divertor endurance</p>

  - elementId: watch-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [450, 398, 240, 46]
    content:
      fontSize: 7.5
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      text: |
        <p><b>Contracted off-take capacity (MW)</b></p>
        <p>Microsoft–Helion 50 MW PPA is the current benchmark (2028 delivery)</p>

  - elementId: watch-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [700, 398, 210, 46]
    content:
      fontSize: 7.5
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      text: |
        <p><b>Licences issued under materials rules</b></p>
        <p>US NRC moved fusion to 10 CFR Part 30 in April 2023</p>

  # Bottom Synthesis Strip
  - elementId: synth-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [50, 472, 860, 32]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$panelBg"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 0.8, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: synth-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [50, 472, 4, 32]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accentBlue"}

  - elementId: synth-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [62, 478, 836, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 8.5
      color: "$ink"
      text: "<b>Final Outlook:</b> Controlled fusion has shifted from a 70-year scientific dream to an engineering industrialization race; winners will be determined by supply-chain execution."

  # Footer Line
  - elementId: footer-line
    elementType: line
    bounds: [50, 514, 860, 1]
    points: "0,0 860,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 0.6, color: "$border"}

  # Footer Source Left
  - elementId: footer-source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 518, 620, 15]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      text: "Source: US Nuclear Regulatory Commission (SECY-23-0001); UK Regulatory Framework for Fusion; GFRI Strategic Roadmap (2026)."

  # Footer Page Right
  - elementId: footer-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [720, 518, 190, 15]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: "Slide 16 / 16"
